  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8450;</mi></math>&nbsp;if the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>, then a value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> is _______."
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
